  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Rural Life: building decentralized, technical assistance methodologies.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperativa de Agricultores Ecolgicos do Portal da Amaznia (Cooperagrepa), $43,000 over one year. Cooperagrepa will develop a plan to organize farmers in municipalities in the north of Mato Grosso and offer them assistance with their production of native fruits and vegetables, organic certification processes and marketing.</narrative>
